{"seq":3,"slug":"buybox-win-competitiveness","title":"Buy Box 赢得率与价格竞争力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/repricing-rule-engine/buybox-win-competitiveness","wordCount":3009,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"buy-box-赢得率与价格竞争力\">Buy Box 赢得率与价格竞争力</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把价格改成比对手低 3%，流量就一定来吗？不一定。在多数电商平台上，同一商品有多个卖家同时在售，而平台只会把<strong>主展示位</strong>（Amazon 称 Featured Offer，业内通称 Buy Box；其他平台称&quot;购物车&quot;&quot;推荐卖家&quot;）给其中一个卖家。这个分配由平台自己的模型决定，价格只是它的输入之一。因此&quot;改价&quot;和&quot;拿到流量&quot;之间隔着一个<strong>平台分配模型</strong>，跟价系统如果只盯着价格而不度量赢得率，就等于在开环控制——动作发出去了，却不知道有没有效果。</p>\n<p>这个认知带来三个工程要求。第一，必须有一个<strong>赢得率指标</strong>（win rate），即某 SKU 在采样时刻被平台把主位给到我们的比例。第二，必须把赢得率与价格<strong>联合</strong>分析，因为两者互为因果——降低价格可能提高赢得率，但赢得率下降也可能诱使我们降价，形成无意义的降价螺旋。第三，必须承认赢得率是<strong>部分可观测量</strong>：我们只能通过采样观察主位归属，采样频率与平台的分位切换会让观测带有噪声。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采集: 主位归属快照] --&gt; B[win_rate 时间序列]&#10;  C[我价 vs 竞品价] --&gt; D[价格竞争力指标]&#10;  B --&gt; E{赢得率是否下降}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|价格已低但赢率不升| F[非价格因素: 配送/评价/库存]&#10;  E --&gt;|价格高且赢率低| G[确认价格劣势]&#10;  E --&gt;|价格低且赢率高| H[健康]&#10;  F --&gt; I[改价无效 回退并排查]&#10;  G --&gt; J[触发跟价 回规则层]&#10;  H --&gt; K[保持]&#10;  I --&gt; L[效果回流到规则参数]&#10;  J --&gt; L\">graph TD\n  A[采集: 主位归属快照] --&gt; B[win_rate 时间序列]\n  C[我价 vs 竞品价] --&gt; D[价格竞争力指标]\n  B --&gt; E{赢得率是否下降}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|价格已低但赢率不升| F[非价格因素: 配送/评价/库存]\n  E --&gt;|价格高且赢率低| G[确认价格劣势]\n  E --&gt;|价格低且赢率高| H[健康]\n  F --&gt; I[改价无效 回退并排查]\n  G --&gt; J[触发跟价 回规则层]\n  H --&gt; K[保持]\n  I --&gt; L[效果回流到规则参数]\n  J --&gt; L</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>价格位置</th>\n<th>赢得率</th>\n<th>解释</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>健康</td>\n<td>低/中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>价格与运营均优</td>\n<td>保持，观察边际</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格劣势</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>典型的该降价信号</td>\n<td>触发跟价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐含劣势</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>价格不是瓶颈</td>\n<td>排查非价格因素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐性优势</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>品牌/配送优势可支撑溢价</td>\n<td>考虑提价测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;隐含劣势&quot;这一格是本文最重要的内容——它是&quot;降价无效&quot;的诊断入口。价格已经比对手低却拿不到主位，说明瓶颈在配送时效、库存稳定性、卖家绩效或评价上，此时继续降价只会白送利润。</p>\n<h2 id=\"赢得率的度量\">赢得率的度量</h2><h3 id=\"定义与采样偏差\">定义与采样偏差</h3><p>赢得率的最基础定义是&quot;在采样时刻，主位归属为我们的比例&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w = \\frac{n_{win}}{n_{win} + n_{lose}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个定义有三个必须处理的偏差。<strong>采样频率偏差</strong>：多数平台的分配会在不同时段切换（例如按履约表现轮转），若你的采集只在某个固定时段跑，得到的赢率是有偏的。<strong>只采到有主位的时刻</strong>：若商品缺货或没有资格，采样可能什么都拿不到，这类时刻应计入 <code>ineligible</code> 而不是偷偷从分母里丢掉。<strong>同日价格变化</strong>：一天内价格可能改过几次，赢率必须按价格分段统计，否则会把高价段的失败与低价段的成功平均成无意义的数字。</p>\n<p>因此赢率的存储不是单个数字，而是带维度的事实表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE buybox_observation (&#10;  sku_id      bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  observed_at timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  channel     text        NOT NULL,&#10;  winner_type text        NOT NULL,   -- us | competitor | amazon_retail | none&#10;  winner_id   text,                   -- 若是对手，其标识&#10;  our_price   numeric(12,2),&#10;  win_price   numeric(12,2),          -- 主位的实际到手价&#10;  eligible    boolean     NOT NULL,   -- 当时是否有资格参与&#10;  price_band  text        NOT NULL,   -- 所属价格区间，用于分段统计&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (sku_id, channel, observed_at)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_bb_sku_time ON buybox_observation (sku_id, observed_at DESC);&#10;&#10;-- 按价格分段的赢得率（消除同日多次改价造成的混淆）&#10;SELECT price_band,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE winner_type = &#39;us&#39;)::numeric&#10;         / NULLIF(count(*) FILTER (WHERE eligible), 0) AS win_rate,&#10;       count(*) AS obs&#10;FROM   buybox_observation&#10;WHERE  sku_id = $1 AND observed_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;GROUP  BY price_band&#10;ORDER  BY price_band;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> buybox_observation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  winner_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- us | competitor | amazon_retail | none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  winner_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 若是对手，其标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  our_price   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  win_price   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 主位的实际到手价</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  eligible    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 当时是否有资格参与</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  price_band  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 所属价格区间，用于分段统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sku_id, channel, observed_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_bb_sku_time</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buybox_observation (sku_id, observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按价格分段的赢得率（消除同日多次改价造成的混淆）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_band,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> winner_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'us'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eligible), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   buybox_observation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_band</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER  BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_band;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"赢得率的置信区间\">赢得率的置信区间</h3><p>赢率是一个比例估计，样本少时不确定性很大。用二项分布的正态近似给出置信区间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>±</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\pm z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\sqrt{\\frac{w(1-w)}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很小（例如一天只采到 5 次）时，区间会宽到覆盖 0 到 1，此时不应据此判定&quot;赢率下降了&quot;。这与 <a href=\"../price-intelligence-data/competitor-price-timeseries\">竞品价格时序与趋势</a> 的&quot;稀疏窗口不输出结论&quot;是同一条纪律。更严格时可对比例用 Wilson 区间，它在极端比例与小额样本下表现更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价格竞争力的定义\">价格竞争力的定义</h2><h3 id=\"价格竞争力不是一个数字\">价格竞争力不是一个数字</h3><p>&quot;价格竞争力&quot;至少要区分三种含义，混用会造成错误决策。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>表达式</th>\n<th>回答</th>\n<th>误用后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相对位置</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{mine}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在组内分布的百分位</td>\n<td>我贵不贵</td>\n<td>忽略非价格因素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与主位价的差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{mine} - P_{win}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不赢得时差距多少</td>\n<td>假设差一点就能赢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与主位价的相对差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(P_{mine} - P_{win})/P_{win}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>差距的比例</td>\n<td>小件品类被绝对差误导</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三个是&quot;赢得所需降幅&quot;的估计。它比绝对差更可用，因为 0.5 美元在 3 美元商品上是 17%，在 100 美元商品上只有 0.5%。实务上系统维护一个<strong>每 SKU 的&quot;赢率-价格差&quot;曲线</strong>：横轴是&quot;我价相对主位价的相对差&quot;，纵轴是在该差价下的赢得率。这条曲线一旦拟合出来，就能回答&quot;再降 1% 能多拿多少赢率&quot;，而这正是规则层设 <code>delta</code> 参数的依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"赢率-价格差曲线\">赢率-价格差曲线</h3><p>曲线本身通常是<strong>单调非增的 S 形</strong>：价格明显低时赢率接近上限（但不会是 100%，因为平台会轮转或有资格限制），价格明显高时赢率接近下限（也很少是 0，因为对手可能缺货）。拟合时有两个陷阱：<strong>内生性</strong>（赢率低导致我们降价，所以观察到的&quot;低价格-高赢率&quot;关系可能被反向因果污染）与<strong>共变量缺失</strong>（配送时效、库存、评价在同期也变了）。</p>\n<p>处理内生性的实用办法是看<strong>准实验</strong>：当我们的价格因规则变化（例如规则版本升级、或某批 SKU 恰好被纳入自动跟价）而外生变化时，用这批 SKU 与未纳入的对照组比较赢率变化。这比回归更容易解释，也更接近因果结论。若没有准实验，则至少要显式标注曲线是&quot;相关性&quot;而非&quot;因果&quot;，避免运营把它当成保证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def fit_win_curve(obs, sku, window_days=30):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;用逻辑回归拟合 win ~ 相对价差 + 控制项；返回预测函数&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    df = obs[(obs.sku_id == sku) &amp; (obs.eligible)]&#10;    df = df[df.observed_at &gt;= df.observed_at.max() - pd.Timedelta(days=window_days)]&#10;    x = pd.DataFrame({&#10;        &quot;rel_gap&quot;: (df.our_price - df.win_price) / df.win_price,&#10;        &quot;in_stock&quot;: df.in_stock.astype(int),&#10;        &quot;ship_speed&quot;: df.ship_speed_days,&#10;    })&#10;    y = (df.winner_type == &quot;us&quot;).astype(int)&#10;    # 单调性约束：rel_gap 的系数应为负&#10;    model = LogisticRegression(penalty=&quot;l2&quot;, C=1.0).fit(x, y)&#10;    return lambda gap: model.predict_proba([[gap, 1, 2]])[0][1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fit_win_curve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(obs, sku, window_days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"用逻辑回归拟合 win ~ 相对价差 + 控制项；返回预测函数\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obs[(obs.sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (obs.eligible)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df[df.observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.observed_at.max() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.Timedelta(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">days</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">window_days)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pd.DataFrame({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"rel_gap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (df.our_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.win_price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.win_price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"in_stock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: df.in_stock.astype(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"ship_speed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: df.ship_speed_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (df.winner_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"us\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).astype(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 单调性约束：rel_gap 的系数应为负</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LogisticRegression(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">penalty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"l2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">C</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).fit(x, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gap: model.predict_proba([[gap, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]])[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>拟合结果服务于规则层的 <code>delta</code> 设定，但<strong>永远不能反向自动调整规则</strong>——因果证据不足时，自动调整会形成&quot;降价→赢率略升→再降价&quot;的正反馈。曲线的更新应当走人工复核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"赢得率的归因\">赢得率的归因</h2><h3 id=\"除价格之外的因素\">除价格之外的因素</h3><p>平台公开的资格与分配因素通常包含：配送方式与时效（自营履约通常有优势）、库存稳定性（缺货会失去资格）、卖家绩效指标（迟发率、取消率、差评率）、商品信息的完整度、以及价格竞争力。这些因素中有些是可运营改进的（库存、绩效），有些是结构性的（履约模式需要重资产投入）。</p>\n<p>工程上要为每个 SKU 维护一张&quot;资格与竞争因素&quot;快照，并在赢率下降时做<strong>特征重要性归因</strong>。最简单的可用做法是对比赢得时刻与失利时刻的特征分布差异（配送时效、库存深度、评价分变化），找出显著差异项。这比上一节的价格曲线更粗糙但更快，适合作为第一层诊断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>可观测性</th>\n<th>可运营改善</th>\n<th>典型影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>到手价</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配送时效</td>\n<td>中（页面展示）</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存稳定性</td>\n<td>高（自己数据）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家绩效</td>\n<td>中（后台）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评价与评分</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品信息完整度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"赢得率变化的告警设计\">赢得率变化的告警设计</h3><p>赢率下降的告警不能只看绝对值，因为不同 SKU 的基线差异巨大（热销品可能常态 90%，长尾品常态 20%）。应当用<strong>相对基线的偏离</strong>并配合最小样本量门槛：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>7 天赢率相对 30 天基线下降超过 15 个百分点，且两个窗口各有至少 20 次有效观测 → 告警；</li>\n<li>与价格变动同时发生 → 归因到价格，转 <a href=\"repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a>；</li>\n<li>价格未变但赢率下降 → 归因到非价格因素，转运营排查；</li>\n<li>突然从有赢率变成 <code>eligible=false</code> → 最高优先级告警（可能是库存或绩效问题导致失去资格）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一条是唯一应该立即叫人的情况，因为它意味着商品已经完全不参与竞争了。</p>\n<p>值得补充的是，赢得率之所以对价格如此敏感，很大程度上是因为<strong>对手也在用同样的机制</strong>。算法定价的常见形态之一就是&quot;自动检测最低竞品价并报出接近它的价格&quot;——例如在最低价附近美元级别的报价；平台（如 Amazon）价格变动频繁，这会促使其他零售商使用价格追踪与自动比价（price-matching）机器人（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Algorithmic_pricing\">Algorithmic pricing</a>）。因此在赢率-价格曲线上观察到的斜率，其实是两个（或多个）反馈回路叠加的结果：你降价 → 对手的机器人跟随 → 赢率回落。这正是下面要讲的降价螺旋，也是为什么单次跟价的收益必须放在&quot;对手会响应&quot;的前提下评估。</p>\n<p>同一份资料还提示了一个合规边界：当价格是通过自动化决策<strong>个性化</strong>给出时，欧盟规则要求披露，而纽约与马里兰州也已出台或推动限制基于消费者个人数据的定价或要求披露。赢得率优化属于&quot;面向全体买家的价格竞争&quot;，与&quot;按用户画像差异化定价&quot;是两件必须分开设计的事——后者的披露义务与公平性约束完全不同，不应在同一个跟价引擎里顺手实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与规则层的闭环\">与规则层的闭环</h2><h3 id=\"效果回流的正确形式\">效果回流的正确形式</h3><p>赢得率数据回流到规则层时，应当是<strong>参数校准的建议</strong>而不是自动调整。可回流的量有三个：某 SKU 的赢率-价格差曲线（用于设定合理 <code>delta</code>）、&quot;降价无效&quot;标记（用于把该 SKU 转为非价格优化目标）、以及失去资格的时段（用于在这些时段暂停跟价——对着一个没有资格的商品跟价毫无意义）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"防止降价螺旋\">防止降价螺旋</h3><p>降价螺旋的机制是：赢率下降 → 降价 → 赢率短暂回升 → 对手跟降 → 赢率再降 → 再降。识别螺旋的信号是：<strong>单位赢率的获取成本持续上升</strong>。定义边际成本</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MC = \\frac{\\Delta P_{mine}}{\\Delta w}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若多次迭代中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 单调上升且绝对值变大，说明每多拿一个百分点赢率要付更多的降价，系统应当触发一次&quot;暂停自动跟价并人工复核&quot;。这条判断依赖 <a href=\"auto-price-execution-safety\">自动改价执行与安全/熔断</a> 的动作台账与本节赢率观测的联合查询，是熔断闸门在效果维度上的补充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与下游的接口\">与下游的接口</h2><p>本文输出的 <code>buybox_observation</code> 与赢率-价格差曲线，一路回流到规则层做参数校准（<a href=\"repricing-rule-guardrail\">跟价规则与利润/品牌价护栏</a>），一路进入治理层做效果审计（<a href=\"../price-governance-anti/repricing-ops-monitor\">跟价运营审计与效果监控</a>）——后者要回答的核心问题正是&quot;这套跟价策略到底有没有带来净收益，还是只是把价格拖低了&quot;。赢率与价格的联合分析也是判断&quot;跟价是否变成集体降价&quot;的实证依据之一，与 <a href=\"../price-governance-anti/price-fixing-manipulation\">价格操纵/共谋风险防控</a> 的动作同步性检查互为印证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>改价与流量之间隔着平台的分配模型，只盯价格不看赢得率就是开环控制。</li>\n<li>赢得率必须按价格分段、按资格分层统计，并显式记录 <code>ineligible</code> 时刻，避免采样偏差与分母丢失。</li>\n<li>赢率是比例估计，样本少时给置信区间（或 Wilson 区间）；稀疏窗口不输出&quot;下降&quot;结论。</li>\n<li>价格竞争力要区分相对位置、与主位价的绝对差、相对差三种定义；&quot;赢率-价格差&quot;曲线是设定跟价幅度的依据。</li>\n<li>拟合曲线要处理内生性，优先用规则变化带来的准实验；曲线只作人工复核的参数建议，绝不自动回写规则。</li>\n<li>&quot;价格已低但赢率低&quot;（隐含劣势）是&quot;降价无效&quot;的诊断入口，应转排查配送、库存、绩效、评价等非价格因素。</li>\n<li>失去 <code>eligible</code> 是最高优先级告警；降价螺旋用边际成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MC=\\Delta P/\\Delta w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的单调上升识别，触发暂停与人工复核。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Buy Box 赢得率与价格竞争力","id":"buy-box-赢得率与价格竞争力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"赢得率的度量","id":"赢得率的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"定义与采样偏差","id":"定义与采样偏差"},{"level":3,"text":"赢得率的置信区间","id":"赢得率的置信区间"},{"level":2,"text":"价格竞争力的定义","id":"价格竞争力的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"价格竞争力不是一个数字","id":"价格竞争力不是一个数字"},{"level":3,"text":"赢率-价格差曲线","id":"赢率-价格差曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"赢得率的归因","id":"赢得率的归因"},{"level":3,"text":"除价格之外的因素","id":"除价格之外的因素"},{"level":3,"text":"赢得率变化的告警设计","id":"赢得率变化的告警设计"},{"level":2,"text":"与规则层的闭环","id":"与规则层的闭环"},{"level":3,"text":"效果回流的正确形式","id":"效果回流的正确形式"},{"level":3,"text":"防止降价螺旋","id":"防止降价螺旋"},{"level":2,"text":"与下游的接口","id":"与下游的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自动改价执行与安全/熔断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/repricing-rule-engine/auto-price-execution-safety"},"next":{"title":"价格操纵/共谋风险防控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/competitor-price-intelligence-repricing/price-governance-anti/price-fixing-manipulation"}}